    p2Reading: (): Part[] => [`On sleep a new sentence frame cost nothing measurable: equivalent within ±${DELTA} pp (`, pp(p2s[0].estimate), ', ', ...iv(p2s[0]), '). The three synonyms per stage scored ', pp(p2s[1].estimate), ' (', ...iv(p2s[1]), ') and new descriptions ', pp(p2s[2].estimate), ' (', ...iv(p2s[2]), '), a wide interval, because descriptions differ a lot from one another. On BETA every rewording scored lower, from ', pp(p2Least.estimate), ' to ', pp(p2Worst.estimate), '; only the synonyms on frozen CBraMod features stayed within the margin.'],
